#: templates/registration/login.html:13
msgid "Your car. Your data."
msgstr "Tu coche. Tus datos."

#: templates/registration/login.html:14
msgid "The quiet"
msgstr "El copiloto"

#: templates/registration/login.html:14
msgid "co-pilot."
msgstr "discreto."

#: templates/registration/login.html:16
msgid ""
"MaTesla is a Python/django free open source website using tesla api to "
"connect to your marvellous Tesla car, have information on its state, "
"location and remote control charge, temperature,... Statistics on firmware "
"updates are also available."
msgstr ""
"MaTesla es un sitio web libre en Python/Django que usa la API de Tesla para "
"conectar con tu coche, ver su estado y ubicación, y controlar a distancia la"
" carga, la temperatura, etc. También hay estadísticas de actualizaciones de "
"firmware."

#: templates/registration/login.html:18
msgid "Open source · your telemetry stays under your control"
msgstr "Código abierto · tu telemetría sigue bajo tu control"

#: templates/registration/login.html:24
msgid "Private space"
msgstr "Espacio privado"

#: templates/registration/login.html:26
msgid "Find your vehicle and its history."
msgstr "Encuentra tu vehículo y su historial."

#: templates/registration/login.html:49
msgid "Forgotten password?"
msgstr "¿Contraseña olvidada?"

#: templates/registration/login.html:50
msgid "Signup"
msgstr "Crear cuenta"

#: templates/registration/login.html:58
msgid "One dashboard, the full story"
msgstr "Un panel, toda la historia"

#: templates/registration/login.html:59
msgid "Beyond a status screen."
msgstr "Más que una pantalla de estado."

#: templates/registration/login.html:60
msgid ""
"Follow battery health, trips and software versions without getting lost in "
"menus."
msgstr ""
"Sigue la salud de la batería, los viajes y las versiones de software sin "
"perderte en menús."

#: templates/registration/login.html:67
msgid "A clear view of how your real range evolves."
msgstr "Una lectura clara de cómo evoluciona tu autonomía real."

#: templates/registration/login.html:74
msgid "Trips & location"
msgstr "Viajes y ubicación"

#: templates/registration/login.html:75
msgid "Find kilometres, cycles and driving days."
msgstr "Encuentra kilómetros, ciclos y días de conducción."

#: templates/registration/login.html:77
msgid "Your tesla odometer graph in function of time. Who drives the most?"
msgstr "Gráfico del odómetro Tesla en función del tiempo. ¿Quién conduce más?"

#: templates/registration/login.html:83
msgid "Every update, placed back in time."
msgstr "Cada actualización, situada en el tiempo."

#: templates/registration/password_reset_complete.html:4
#: templates/registration/password_reset_complete.html:10
msgid "Password updated"
msgstr "Contraseña actualizada"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_complete.html:9
msgid "Ready to drive"
msgstr "Listo para conducir"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_complete.html:11
msgid "Your password has been set. You may go ahead and sign in."
msgstr "Tu contraseña se ha establecido. Ya puedes iniciar sesión."

#: templates/registration/password_reset_complete.html:12
msgid "sign in"
msgstr "iniciar sesión"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_confirm.html:4
#: templates/registration/password_reset_confirm.html:11
#: templates/registration/password_reset_confirm.html:23
msgid "Change password"
msgstr "Cambiar contraseña"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_confirm.html:10
msgid "Secure account"
msgstr "Cuenta segura"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_confirm.html:12
msgid "Choose a new password to get back into your space."
msgstr "Elige una nueva contraseña para volver a tu espacio."

#: templates/registration/password_reset_confirm.html:26
msgid "Expired link"
msgstr "Enlace caducado"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_confirm.html:27
msgid "Invalid link"
msgstr "Enlace no válido"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_confirm.html:28
msgid ""
"The password reset link was invalid, possibly because it has already been "
"used. Please request a new password reset."
msgstr ""
"El enlace de restablecimiento no es válido, quizá porque ya se usó. Solicita"
" uno nuevo."

#: templates/registration/password_reset_confirm.html:29
#: templates/registration/password_reset_form.html:4
#: templates/registration/password_reset_form.html:11
msgid "Password reset"
msgstr "Restablecer contraseña"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_done.html:4
#: templates/registration/password_reset_done.html:10
msgid "Password reset mail sent"
msgstr "Correo de restablecimiento enviado"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_done.html:9
msgid "Check your inbox"
msgstr "Revisa tu bandeja de entrada"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_done.html:11
msgid ""
"We&#39;ve emailed you instructions for setting your password, if an account "
"exists with the email you entered. You should receive them shortly."
msgstr ""
"Te hemos enviado instrucciones para establecer la contraseña, si existe una "
"cuenta con ese correo. Deberías recibirlas en breve."

#: templates/registration/password_reset_done.html:12
msgid ""
"If you don&#39;t receive an email, please make sure you&#39;ve entered the "
"address you registered with, and check your spam folder."
msgstr ""
"Si no recibes un correo, comprueba que hayas introducido la dirección de "
"registro y revisa la carpeta de spam."

#: templates/registration/password_reset_done.html:13
#: templates/registration/password_reset_form.html:28
msgid "Back to login"
msgstr "Volver al inicio de sesión"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_email.html:3
msgid "To initiate the password reset process for your"
msgstr "Para iniciar el restablecimiento de contraseña de tu"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_email.html:3
msgid "MaTesla Account, click the link below:"
msgstr "cuenta MaTesla, haz clic en el enlace siguiente:"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_email.html:7
msgid ""
"If clicking the link above doesn't work, please copy and paste the URL in a "
"new browser window instead."
msgstr ""
"Si el enlace no funciona, copia y pega la URL en una nueva ventana del "
"navegador."

#: templates/registration/password_reset_email.html:9
msgid "Sincerely, The MaTesla Team"
msgstr "Atentamente, el equipo MaTesla"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_form.html:10
msgid "Account recovery"
msgstr "Recuperación de cuenta"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_form.html:12
msgid ""
"Enter the address linked to your account. We will send you a secure link."
msgstr ""
"Indica la dirección asociada a tu cuenta. Te enviaremos un enlace seguro."

#: templates/registration/password_reset_form.html:25
msgid "Send e-mail"
msgstr "Enviar correo"

